@startuml
title D&D Simple - Dashboard Autosave Flow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
autonumber

actor User
participant "CharacterDashboardPage" as Page
participant "useDashboardAutosave" as Autosave
participant "updateCharacter" as UpdateApi
participant "charactersRouter" as Router
participant "requireAuth" as Auth
participant "character.controller" as Controller
participant "character.service" as Service
database "PostgreSQL via Prisma" as DB

User -> Page: Edit dashboard build/local UI state
Page -> Page: Build full CharacterSavePayload
note right of Page
Current implementation sends a full
CharacterSavePayload, not only changed fields.
end note
Page -> Autosave: payload + save callbacks
Autosave -> Autosave: Build stable payload signature
note right of Autosave
saveStatus is hook state.
The dashboard currently renders only
error feedback and retry, not normal
Saving/Saved status text.
end note

alt Signature matches last saved signature
  Autosave -> Autosave: Clear timer and set internal saved/idle
else Signature changed
  Autosave -> Autosave: Set internal dirty state
  Autosave -> Autosave: Start 900 ms debounce
end

alt Debounce expires
  Autosave -> Autosave: flushSave("debounced")
else Manual retry/save
  User -> Autosave: flushSave("manual")
else Lifecycle event
  Autosave -> Autosave: flushSave("lifecycle")
  note right of Autosave
  keepalive is requested only for
  lifecycle saves with JSON length <= 60000.
  end note
end

Autosave -> UpdateApi: PATCH request with payload
UpdateApi -> Router: PATCH /characters/:id
Router -> Auth: require bearer token
Auth --> Router: authenticated user
Router -> Controller: updateCharacter handler
Controller -> Controller: Validate and normalize body
Controller -> Service: updateCharacterForUser(userId, id, data)
Service -> DB: Begin transaction
Service -> DB: Verify owned character
Service -> DB: Load reference rows
Service -> Service: Validate selections and recalculate fields
Service -> DB: Update character and related rows
Service -> DB: Refetch updated character
DB --> Service: Updated Character graph
Service --> Controller: Updated Character
Controller --> UpdateApi: JSON response
UpdateApi --> Autosave: Updated Character
Autosave -> Autosave: Ignore if stale, otherwise update saved signature
Autosave -> Page: onSaved(updatedCharacter)
Page -> Page: Replace local character and rerender

@enduml
